Custom website vs Ready-Made website


| Custom-Made Website           | Ready-Made Website             |
| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------ |
| Built from scratch            | Already designed               |
| More coding                   | Less coding                    |
| Full control                  | Template-based                 |
| Direct integration possible   | Usually embed using URL/iframe |
| Example: Flask/Django website | Example: WordPress + Elementor |


Your CKD project can be added to both.

Custom-made website: integrate the CKD feature directly into the website code.
Ready-made website: deploy the CKD app and embed its public URL using an iframe or embed widget.

A ready-made website can host the CKD app through an embedded public URL, while a custom site can integrate it directly; 
compare both options for cost, control, security, and maintenance before choosing.

